    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Minimal, dependency-free HTTP/1.1 server used to host the provider state change endpoint required by Pact verification.</para>
<para>It is deliberately small (single connection at a time, <computeroutput>Connection: close</computeroutput>) because the Pact verifier drives the provider sequentially. It is also useful for standing up a stub provider in your own tests, but it is not intended to be a general purpose production web server. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
